// EXPECTED: compile error
// expect-error: static local 'c' is accessed from both interrupt and main code
// BUG-967 (2026-09-07): the ISR sibling. `helper` is reached from the interrupt
// AND from main, so its `static u32 c` is shared between the two contexts
// exactly like a global — but the ISR recorder resolved names through the
// global scope and never saw it, so the non-volatile RMW compiled (torn update
// on bare metal, no diagnostic).
void helper() { static u32 c = 0; c += 1; }
interrupt TIM1 { helper(); }
u32 main() { helper(); return 0; }
